title: "South Signal Lab CLOCK"
type: software
version: 0.19.0-alpha.62
date-released: 2026-09-09
authors:
  - given-names: Axel
    family-names: Napolitano
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
abstract: >-
  South Signal Lab CLOCK is an eight-output Eurorack precision clock, Euclidean
  rhythm, gate-sequencer, and divider firmware for the STM32F401CCU6 platform,
  with deterministic timing, external synchronization, persistent presets, and
  a native desktop simulator.
keywords:
  - eurorack
  - modular synthesizer
  - clock generator
  - trigger sequencer
  - gate sequencer
  - euclidean rhythm
  - rhythm generator
  - STM32F401
  - embedded firmware
  - PlatformIO
  - music technology
